{"pull": {"id": "number:20253", "number": 20253, "title": "KAFKA-19555: Restrict records acquisition post max in-flight limit", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-07-28T19:00:44Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-29T09:40:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-29T09:40:06Z", "user": {"login": "apoorvmittal10", "id": 2861565, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI4NjE1NjU=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2861565?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10", "html_url": "https://github.com/apoorvmittal10", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/apoorvmittal10/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The PR restricts the records being acquired post max-inflight limit.\nPreviously the max in-flight limit was only enforced while considering\nthe share partition for further fetches i.e. once the limit was reached\nthe share partition was not considered for further fetches. However,\nwhen the records are actively released then there might be some records\nbeing acquired post max-inflight limit. This is evident with higher\nnumber of consumers reading from same share partition and releasing the\nrecords.\n\nReviewers: Andrew Schofield <aschofield@confluent.io>, Lan Ding\n <isDing_L@163.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 838330122, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MzgzMzAxMjI=